20. Consideration of liquor license fees for July 1, 2024, through June 30, 2025.
24 - 087
Liquor License fees for 2024
Attachments:
County Clerk Debra Lee presented the schedule for liquor license fees. She noted the
only change was that both categories of retail liquor licenses would be $850, which is
a reduction from $1,500 within the five-mile radius of the city limits category because
of a statutory change and clarification from the WY Liquor Division.
Acting Chairman Malm opened the meeting for PUBLIC COMMENT. Hearing no
PUBLIC COMMENT, Acting Chairman Malm closed the comment period.
