22. PUBLIC HEARING regarding a zone change from A1 - Agricultural &
Rural Residential to AR - Agricultural Residential for a portion of the
W1/2, NE1/4, NW1/4 of Sect 5, T14N, R66W, of the 6th PM, Laramie
County, WY, and a subdivision permit and plat for Beer Gardens
Subdivision, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 092
Beer Gardens, Zone Change and Subdivision Permit
and Plat
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said Steil Surveying Services, LLC, on behalf of Steven J
Beer, submitted zone change and subdivision permit and plat applications for a
parcel in the NW1/4 of Sect 5, T14N, R66W, 6th PM, Laramie County, WY, to be
known as the Beer Gardens Subdivision. He said the subject property lies between
1733 Iron Mountain Rd and 1919 Iron Mountain Rd.
Arnold said the applications were submitted to request a zone change from A1 -
Agricultural and Rural Residential to AR Agricultural Residential and to subdivide the
property into three tracts. Both applications were combined into one staff report for
ease of presentation and discussion, with separate motions required.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval of the zone
change with the adoption of findings of fact a and b and approval of the subdivision
permit and plat with the adoption of findings of fact c, both approvals with no
