### Page 8 of 8

```text
Board of County Commissioners
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
March 5, 2024
24. Consideration of a resolution imposing Stage 2 fire restrictions for
Laramie County, WY, as a result of extreme fire danger.
24 - 113
Resolution, Imposing Stage 2 Fire Restrictions
Attachments:
Matt Butler, Fire Warden, presented the resolution and said it would become effective
March 6, 2024, at 8 am. He said there have been several fires within the last two
weeks.
The board spoke about the current severe and dry conditions and requested citizens
be proactive.
A motion was made by Commissioner Holmes, seconded by
Commissioner Heath, that this agenda item be approved. The motion
carried by the following vote:
Malm, Heath, Holmes, Thompson
Aye:
Lovett
Excused:
The meeting adjourned at 4:02 pm.
CERTIFICATION
I, Debra K. Lee, Clerk of Laramie County, do hereby certify the above to be a true
and correct copy of the Minutes of the Proceedings for Tuesday, March 5, 2024.
